    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/d36b326de10cf52187a2d656d8df2700.poster.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/d36b326de10cf52187a2d656d8df2700.webm?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/d36b326de10cf52187a2d656d8df2700.mp4?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Welcome to Millennium Arcade!</strong><br><br>Embark on a journey through the memory of a millennial in this arcade platform full of small indie games inspired by the golden age of entertainment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Masters of the Void</strong></h2>A scifi multiplayer shooter where you fly between multiple ships to capture objective points.<br>Fly to the battleship for FPS action, or battle it out in space!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c163ad76db1c3a01fc3e25c0695036ed.poster.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c163ad76db1c3a01fc3e25c0695036ed.webm?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c163ad76db1c3a01fc3e25c0695036ed.mp4?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Appearance</h2>Modify your appearance to your heart's content! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c14758988dd831ad68e508b7d63b470a.poster.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c14758988dd831ad68e508b7d63b470a.webm?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c14758988dd831ad68e508b7d63b470a.mp4?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Akui No Kin</strong><br>An isometric roguelike where you cleanse humanoid and animal monsters consumed by greed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/77c762174666ff99f1b8450e3a3123a2.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 /></span><br></li><li><strong>Pompeii '72</strong><br>Pompeii has exploded! Go NOW!Drive across lava flows to safety!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/868bf3893b0337e972b2c0541dc97ecd.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 /></span><br></li><li><strong>LarperZ</strong><br>A zombie survival game about the time there was a zombie outbreak when you when Larping!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/ae8a5446e47a2fc0d32412b0630b3cf1.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 /></span></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/d36b326de10cf52187a2d656d8df2700.poster.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/d36b326de10cf52187a2d656d8df2700.webm?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/d36b326de10cf52187a2d656d8df2700.mp4?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Welcome to Millennium Arcade!</strong><br><br>Embark on a journey through the memory of a millennial in this arcade platform full of small indie games inspired by the golden age of entertainment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Masters of the Void</strong></h2>A scifi multiplayer shooter where you fly between multiple ships to capture objective points.<br>Fly to the battleship for FPS action, or battle it out in space!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c163ad76db1c3a01fc3e25c0695036ed.poster.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c163ad76db1c3a01fc3e25c0695036ed.webm?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c163ad76db1c3a01fc3e25c0695036ed.mp4?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Appearance</h2>Modify your appearance to your heart's content! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c14758988dd831ad68e508b7d63b470a.poster.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c14758988dd831ad68e508b7d63b470a.webm?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/c14758988dd831ad68e508b7d63b470a.mp4?t=1712145740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Akui No Kin</strong><br>An isometric roguelike where you cleanse humanoid and animal monsters consumed by greed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/77c762174666ff99f1b8450e3a3123a2.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 /></span><br></li><li><strong>Pompeii '72</strong><br>Pompeii has exploded! Go NOW!Drive across lava flows to safety!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/868bf3893b0337e972b2c0541dc97ecd.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 /></span><br></li><li><strong>LarperZ</strong><br>A zombie survival game about the time there was a zombie outbreak when you when Larping!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845660/extras/ae8a5446e47a2fc0d32412b0630b3cf1.avif?t=1712145740\" width=600 height=320 /></span></li></ul>",
